<view class="page safe-bottom"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo-banner">演示模式 · 本机体验，不会发生真实转账</view><view class="eyebrow">记下每一次结清</view><view class="heading">{{editing?'修改还款记录':'登记实际还款'}}</view><view class="subtitle">完成实际转账后，再来这里留个记录。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<view wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="link" bindtap="refreshVersion">刷新账本版本，保留草稿后重试</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载同行成员…</view><block wx:else><view class="grid2"><view><text class="form-label">付款人</text><picker range="{{names}}" value="{{fromIndex}}" data-field="fromIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{names[fromIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view><text class="form-label">收款人</text><picker range="{{names}}" value="{{toIndex}}" data-field="toIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{names[toIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><text class="form-label">还款金额 · {{currency}}</text><input class="input amount-input" type="digit" value="{{amount}}" placeholder="0" data-field="amount" bindinput="field"/><text class="form-label">还款日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" data-field="date" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{date}}</view></picker><view class="help">登记后会重新计算所有成员余额。此操作不会自动扣款，也不会发起微信支付。</view><button class="button primary" disabled="{{saving || members.length&lt;2}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存还款记录</button></block></view>
